<title>USA: Bank N.Y. holds 5.04 pct State St stake.</title>
<headline>Bank N.Y. holds 5.04 pct State St stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of New York Co Inc on Friday said it and its subsidiaries hold a 5.04 percent stake or 4,035,620 common shares in State Street Boston Corp.</p>
<p>Bank of New York made the disclosure in a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
